  'protein methylation' => 'Addition of methyl groups to selected amino-acid residues, regulating protein activity, chromatin, signaling, and gene expression.',
  'protein overexpression' => 'Production of an abnormally large amount of a protein, caused by gene amplification, transcriptional activation, altered degradation, or other mechanisms and potentially driving disease or serving as a biomarker.',
